          "linkId": "glc-ed",
          "text": "Glaucoma damages the optic nerve, often without pain. Vision lost to glaucoma does not return. Daily drops only work if they reach the eye: one drop, close eyes 1 minute, wait 5 minutes between bottles. Do not stop drops because the eye 'feels fine.' Missed doses: take the next dose as scheduled unless your doctor said otherwise. Keep OCT and visual field appointments even when vision seems stable.",
